=== Sum of divisor products mod 1e9+7 ===
S( 10) mod 1e9+7 = 231 (sieve: 231) ✓
S( 50) mod 1e9+7 = 263680819 (sieve: 263680819) ✓
S(100) mod 1e9+7 = 270291263 (sieve: 270291263) ✓

